tart=\"560\" data-end=\"584\">Modern Round Design:</strong> Minimalist circular shape enhances any contemporary interior décor.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rtdn19\" data-start=\"653\" data-end=\"739\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"655\" data-end=\"672\">Optimal Size:</strong> 24 x 24 inches—perfectly balanced for both small and large spaces.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2ecmqy\" data-start=\"740\" data-end=\"850\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"767\">Touch Sensor Control:</strong> Easy on/off function with a smooth touch button (optional if your product has it).\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c8i4iy\" data-start=\"851\" data-end=\"963\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"853\" data-end=\"886\">Anti-Fog Function (Optional):</strong> Keeps the mirror clear even in humid conditions (mention only if available).\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1atlg64\" data-start=\"964\" data-end=\"1055\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"966\" data-end=\"989\">High-Quality Glass:</strong> Crystal-clear reflection with durable and long-lasting materials.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c8day0\" data-start=\"1056\" data-end=\"1128\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1058\" data-end=\"1075\">Wall Mounted:</strong> Easy to install and suitable for vertical placement.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul><p data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1149\"><strong data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1149\">Specifications:</strong></p><ul data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1291\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ochh6n\" data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1166\">\r\nShape: Round\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hsbgxb\" data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1186\">\r\nSize: 24\" x 24\"\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o56af5\" data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1204\">\r\nLighting: LED\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5n72cs\" data-start=\"1205\" data-end=\"1240\">\r\nInstallation Type: Wall Mounted\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17jfc5w\" data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1291\">\r\nUsage: Bathroom, Bedroom, Salon, Dressing Room\r\n</li>\r\n</ul><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1509\"><strong data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1320\">Why Choose This Mirror?</strong><br data-start=\"1320\" data-end=\"1323\">\r\nEnhance your daily routine with a perfect blend of <strong data-start=\"1374\" data-end=\"1412\">style, clarity, and smart lighting</strong>. This LED mirror not only brightens your space but also adds a luxurious touch to your interior.</p>', 3500.00, 3800.00, 3800.00, 0.00, 'amount', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Round Mirror 001', 'Round LED Mirror 24\" x 24\"Upgrade your space with this stylish and modern 24 x 24 inch Round LED Mirror, designed to add elegance and functionality to any room. Perfect for bathrooms, bedrooms, dressing areas, or salons, this mirror combines sleek design with advanced lighting technology.Key Features:\r\n\r\nPremium LED Lighting: Built-in energy-efficient LED lights provide bright, even illumination—ideal for makeup, grooming, and daily use.\r\n\r\n\r\nModern Round Design: Minimalist circular shape enhances any contemporary interior décor.\r\n\r\n\r\nOptimal Size: 24 x 24 inches—perfectly balanced for both small and large spaces.\r\n\r\n\r\nTouch Sensor Control: Easy on/off function with a smooth touch button (optional if your product has it).\r\n\r\n\r\nAnti-Fog Function (Optional): Keeps the mirror clear even in humid conditions (mention only if available).\r\n\r\n\r\nHigh-Quality Glass: Crystal-clear reflection with durable and long-lasting materials.\r\n\r\n\r\nWall Mounted: Easy to install and suitable for vertical placement.\r\n\r\nSpecifications:\r\n\r\nShape: Round\r\n\r\n\r\nSize: 24\" x 24\"\r\n\r\n\r\nLighting: LED\r\n\r\n\r\nInstallation Type: Wall Mounted\r\n\r\n\r\nUsage: Bathroom, Bedroom, Salon, Dressing Room\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nWhy Choose This Mirror?\r\nEnhance your daily routine with a perfect blend of style, clarity, and smart lighting. This LED mirror not only brightens your space but also adds a luxurious touch to your interior.', 'storage/media/product/2026-04-22-vnr7mvjdnHquMsztsvmMlg0pEznCMJpqyWbeUcbg.webp', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-06 21:56:45', '2026-04-22 07:07:19'),
