 premium materials for long-term use.</li></ul><h4 data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1056\" math\";\"=\"\" style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(39, 45, 71); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">🏠 Ideal For:</h4><ul data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1127\" math\";=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;\"=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(63, 66, 84); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><li data-section-id=\"xm07qs\" data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1066\">Bedroom</li><li data-section-id=\"qsfg84\" data-start=\"1067\" data-end=\"1082\">Dressing room</li><li data-section-id=\"178ln07\" data-start=\"1083\" data-end=\"1090\">Salon</li><li data-section-id=\"18h1j1k\" data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1101\">Bathroom</li><li data-section-id=\"wopuom\" data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1127\">Retail or studio setups</li></ul><h4 data-start=\"1129\" data-end=\"1152\" math\";\"=\"\" style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(39, 45, 71); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">⚙️ Specifications:</h4><ul data-start=\"1153\" data-end=\"1336\" math\";=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;\"=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(63, 66, 84); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><li data-section-id=\"1avqmb8\" data-start=\"1153\" data-end=\"1188\"><span data-start=\"1155\" data-end=\"1165\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Model:</span>&nbsp;Others Mirror</li><li data-section-id=\"1kmutin\" data-start=\"1189\" data-end=\"1212\"><span data-start=\"1191\" data-end=\"1200\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Size:</span>&nbsp; 22\" x 30\"</li><li data-section-id=\"23vy4h\" data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1245\"><span data-start=\"1215\" data-end=\"1224\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Type:</span>&nbsp;LED Lighted Mirror</li><li data-section-id=\"6ounpb\" data-start=\"1246\" data-end=\"1272\"><span data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1258\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Shape:</span>&nbsp;Others</li><li data-section-id=\"1858qll\" data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1336\"><span data-start=\"1275\" data-end=\"1292\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\