 Mirror?Enhance your daily routine with perfect lighting and a stylish design. Whether you\'re getting ready for the day or upgrading your décor, this LED mirror offers both beauty and practicality.', 'storage/media/product/2026-03-07-uZfbBD8l6MRdeXasfoVAXZvEiJFSq5hVXlp6vrx3.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-07 02:23:45', '2026-04-13 22:00:53'),
