: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span style=\"border-color: rgb(226, 232, 240); --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(59,130,246,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Collectors who value kits as cultural artifacts and symbols of legacy.</span></p></li></ul>', 300.00, 500.00, 500.00, 0.00, 'amount', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Portugal World Cup 26 Away Kit Kids', 'A Fresh Chapter in Blue &amp; WhiteThe Portugal 2026 World Cup Away Kit for kids reimagines tradition with a bold, modern twist. Featuring a striking light blue and white abstract pattern accented with teal details, this kit symbolizes Portugal’s fearless spirit as they step onto football’s biggest stage.Design &amp; DetailsColorway: Light blue and white with teal accents for a vibrant, contemporary look.Crest: Official Portugal Football Federation emblem proudly displayed on the chest and shorts.Branding: Premium Puma detailing for authenticity and performance.Fabric Tech: DRYCELL moisture-wicking technology ensures comfort, keeping young fans cool and dry during play.Fit: Athletic cut jersey with breathable fabric and elastic waistband shorts for unrestricted movement.Why It MattersThis away kit is more than just a uniform — it’s a statement of Portugal’s evolving identity. For kids, it’s a chance to wear the same colors their heroes carry into battle, embodying both tradition and innovation. The golden trophy imagery alongside the kit reminds every young fan of the dream: lifting football’s ultimate prize.Perfect ForYoung supporters eager to showcase their pride in Portugal.Parents gifting their children a piece of World Cup history.Collectors who value kits as cultural artifacts and symbols of legacy.', 'storage/media/product/2026-04-11-joVg0AaoHxBJF7H2s1S1TNX8ogMcTNqSdLFejtlL.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-10 18:34:01', '2026-04-11 00:34:21');
