moves with the body during high-speed play.Signature 3-Stripes:&nbsp;The iconic shoulder stripes are rendered in bold black, stretching from the collar to the edge of the shoulder for a classic athletic look.Advanced Cooling Technology:&nbsp;Integrated with high-performance breathable fabric and laser-cut ventilation zones to manage moisture and airflow in peak competitive conditions.Authenticity:&nbsp;Includes the official \"Authentic Licensed Product\" silver locker tag at the bottom hem, marking it as a genuine professional-grade garment.Product SpecificationsMaterial:&nbsp;100% Recycled Polyester (High-Performance Mesh-Infused Fabric).Sleeve Style:&nbsp;Short sleeves with ribbed black cuffs.Collar:&nbsp;Ribbed V-neck in deep black.Branding:&nbsp;Heat-applied monochrome Belgium crest and Adidas branding.The Ultimate KeepsakeA true fusion of high-fashion and high-performance, the&nbsp;Belgium Away Player Edition&nbsp;is more than a jersey—it’s a statement. Whether you’re a professional athlete, a die-hard supporter, or a collector of unique footballing aesthetics, this kit represents the bold future of Belgian football.', 'storage/media/product/2026-04-11-k404FInvtW69LHqHSrLTLklSKIaUEWQ2wzRanh06.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-10 18:40:27', '2026-04-11 00:35:43');
