: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(59,130,246,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; font-weight: bolder;\">jacquard-woven away player edition jersey</span> is the definitive choice. It bridges the gap between high-performance sports apparel and profound cultural artistry.</p>', 400.00, 700.00, 700.00, 0.00, 'amount', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Spain World Cup 2026 Away Kit Player Edition', 'Design &amp; AestheticThis&nbsp;Spain 2026 World Cup Away Player Edition Jersey&nbsp;is a study in sophisticated detail, departing from simple colors to weave a complex narrative of Spanish artistry. The base color is a refined, light-grey textured weave, but far from plain, it features an all-over, tonal, abstract&nbsp;jacquard pattern&nbsp;inspired by intricate traditional Spanish tilework (Azulejo) and Mudejar art motifs. This creates a subtle, light-on-light pattern that reveals itself upon close inspection, suggesting depth and history.Player Edition Performance Tech &amp; Refined DetailsEngineered for the elite stage, this jersey features the pinnacle of garment technology, including:Heat-Applied, Tonal Crest:&nbsp;The Spanish national federation emblem and the world championship star are rendered in a deep, metallic burgundy and silver-grey, applied with precision heat-transfer to minimize weight. The \'RFEF\' text is crisp and dark.Athletic Fit:&nbsp;A sleek, contoured \"Race Fit\" designed to reduce wind resistance and allow for maximum range of motion, featuring a drop-tail hem.Maroon and Gold Trim:&nbsp;A distinct feature is the structured V-neck collar, which has a dual-layer cuff in a deep&nbsp;maroon&nbsp;and a polished&nbsp;gold&nbsp;band. This is mirrored precisely on the sleeve cuffs.Contrasting Shoulder Stripes:&nbsp;The signature Adidas 3-Stripes are rendered in the same deep&nbsp;maroon&nbsp;on each shoulder.Advanced Ventilation:&nbsp;Zone-mapped cooling panels are strategically placed on the sides and back, integrated into the jacquard pattern, to optimize airflow.The \'Azulejo\' Sun Motif:&nbsp;Unique and hidden on the inner collar is a beautiful, abstract&nbsp;stylized sun and rosette motif, detailed with gold and maroon, visible only on the hanger.Authentic Label:&nbsp;An official player-edition \"Authentic\" locker tag is heat-applied to the bottom right hem.Product SpecificationsMaterial:&nbsp;100% Recycled Polyester (High-Performance Jacquard-Woven Technical Fabric).Sleeve Style:&nbsp;Short white/grey sleeves with maroon and gold cuffs.Collar:&nbsp;V-neck with maroon and gold trim.Branding:&nbsp;Tonal maroon/silver crest, heat-applied stars, Adidas logo.The Ultimate KeepsakeWhether you are an active player demanding professional-grade gear, a dedicated fan supporting&nbsp;La Roja, or a collector seeking a unique piece of design, this&nbsp;jacquard-woven away player edition jersey&nbsp;is the definitive choice. It bridges the gap between high-performance sports apparel and profound cultural artistry.', 'storage/media/product/2026-04-11-2aYhni5dT7JwJBzt58zTxTLXW2BZ7LOfBy1A12tu.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-10 18:43:28', '2026-04-11 00:35:25');
