position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(59,130,246,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; font-weight: bolder;\">The Ultimate Keepsake</span></h6><p data-path-to-node=\"10\" style=\"border-color: rgb(226, 232, 240); --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(59,130,246,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; margin-bottom: 0px; color: rgb(57, 28, 29); font-family: AdihausDIN, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">This France Away Player Edition jersey is more than performance gear; it is an artifact that balances technical perfection with profound cultural artistry. Whether you are an active player demanding professional-grade tech, a dedicated fan supporting <i data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"251\" style=\"border-color: rgb(226, 232, 240); --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(59,130,246,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ;\">Les Bleus</i>, or a collector seeking a unique piece of kit design, this mint green toile de Jouy jersey is the definitive choice.</p>', 400.00, 700.00, 700.00, 0.00, 'amount', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'France World Cup 2026 Away Kit Player Edition', 'Design &amp; AestheticThis&nbsp;France 2026 World Cup Away Player Edition Jersey&nbsp;redefines elegance, moving beyond simple color to a sophisticated narrative of French culture. The base is an exquisite, pale&nbsp;mint green, providing a fresh and distinct canvas. Far from plain, it features a complex, subtle&nbsp;jacquard-woven pattern&nbsp;across the entire body, showcasing abstract motifs inspired by traditional French toile de Jouy textiles—specifically featuring stylized local flora and iconic landmark elements, visible only upon close inspection.Player Edition Performance Tech &amp; Refined DetailsEngineered for the elite stage with the pinnacle of garment technology, featuring exclusive design cues:The Crest:&nbsp;A spectacular, multi-toned&nbsp;embossed and multi-color metallic rooster (Gallic Rooster), rendered in iridescent shades of orange, blue, and gold, representing a fusion of nature and modern design. It is crowned by two gold stars, precisely heat-applied.Tricolore Accent Cuffs:&nbsp;The short sleeves are finished with a crisp, ribbed cuff featuring a&nbsp;perfect representation of the French flag (blue-white-red)&nbsp;as a border, mirrored on the inner back collar.Golden-Brown Piping:&nbsp;As a key unifying element from the home kit design, a clean, structured&nbsp;golden-brown piping&nbsp;trace the collar, shoulders, and sides, framing the complex jacquard weave.Inner Collar \'Sun\' Motif:&nbsp;A unique and beautiful&nbsp;stylized sun and rosette motif&nbsp;in the same golden-brown is intricately detailed on the inner neck tape, visible on the hanger.Technical Performance:Athletic Fit:&nbsp;A sleek, contoured \"Race Fit\" to reduce wind resistance.Zoned Cooling:&nbsp;Precision-mapped breathable panels are integrated into the jacquard weave for optimal airflow.Moisture Management:&nbsp;Lightweight, recycled technical fabric that draws sweat away instantly.Product SpecificationsMaterial:&nbsp;100% Recycled Polyester (High-Performance Jacquard-Woven Technical Fabric).Sleeve Style:&nbsp;Short mint green sleeves with Tricolore (blue-white-red) cuffs.Collar:&nbsp;V-neck with blue-white-red inner trim.Branding:&nbsp;Official authentic heat-applied rooster crest with stars and a distinct player-edition \'engineered\' locker tag at the hem.The Ultimate KeepsakeThis France Away Player Edition jersey is more than performance gear; it is an artifact that balances technical perfection with profound cultural artistry. Whether you are an active player demanding professional-grade tech, a dedicated fan supporting&nbsp;Les Bleus, or a collector seeking a unique piece of kit design, this mint green toile de Jouy jersey is the definitive choice.', 'storage/media/product/2026-04-11-x2SFewsEPsYdDp2Ia41kQNAUXw3bWZWvkrH4Y09y.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-10 18:46:35', '2026-04-11 00:35:11');
