tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; font-weight: bolder;\">Tricolor Detailing:</span> The V-neck and sleeve cuffs feature a sharp White/Navy/Mint tricolor ribbing, ensuring a crisp, athletic finish.</p></li></ul>', 300.00, 500.00, 500.00, 0.00, 'amount', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Germany World Cup 2026 Away kit Fan Edition', 'The&nbsp;Germany 2026 World Cup Away Fan Kit (Half)&nbsp;is a masterclass in modern football aesthetics, merging a bold new color palette with the deep-rooted history of the DFB. As the final away kit produced by Adidas before the transition to Nike, this jersey serves as a high-performance farewell to a legendary partnership.Germany 2026 World Cup Away Fan Kit (Half)Embrace the future of the Nationalmannschaft with a design that breaks from tradition while honoring the \"Miracle of Bern.\" This kit is designed for the fans who carry the four stars of world dominance into a new era of North American glory.Design &amp; LegacyCollegiate Navy &amp; Mint Fusion:&nbsp;A first-of-its-kind colorway for Germany, combining a deep navy base with vibrant mint accents—a maritime-inspired nod to the team\'s relentless energy and \"cool\" composure.Reimagined Zig-Zag Pattern:&nbsp;The jersey features a subtle, tonal jacquard zig-zag motif across the torso, drawing inspiration from iconic 1990s patterns and vintage Adidas DNA.\"Seit 1954\" Sign-off:&nbsp;A premium detail at the hem commemorates the year of Germany’s first World Cup title, grounding this modern look in the heritage of champions.Four-Star Crest:&nbsp;The iconic DFB eagle is crowned with four stars, representing the historic triumphs of 1954, 1974, 1990, and 2014.Performance &amp; ComfortFan Edition Ergonomics:&nbsp;Offers a comfortable, relaxed fit that mirrors the professional silhouette while providing all-day wearability for the streets or the stands.Climacool Technology:&nbsp;Engineered with advanced moisture-wicking fabric to keep you dry and ventilated under pressure.Tricolor Detailing:&nbsp;The V-neck and sleeve cuffs feature a sharp White/Navy/Mint tricolor ribbing, ensuring a crisp, athletic finish.', 'storage/media/product/2026-04-11-inv4xnRasVk50jPeqtaOaPUxnsBrgoOpgEvmuO7u.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-10 18:57:30', '2026-04-10 23:48:21');
