at still honors Brazil’s timeless footballing spirit.For Collectors: A rare fusion of Seleção heritage and Jordan’s global influence.For the Game: Proof that kits can be cultural artifacts, not just uniforms.', 'storage/media/product/2026-04-11-NxlUTb1RTMFjjhkzOUbBQEcWqkZ8K1Dl92rQpYtV.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-10 19:00:39', '2026-04-10 23:47:58');
