 the ocean itself.</p>', 400.00, 800.00, 800.00, 0.00, 'amount', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Portugal World Cup 2026 Home Kit Player Edition Full', 'Design Inspiration:&nbsp;This kit embodies a kinetic and structured visualization of Portugal\'s historic spirit—the&nbsp;\"Legacy of Discovery.\"&nbsp;It channels the fluid yet precise geometry of navigation charts, the intricate detail of an armillary sphere, and the rhythmic pattern of the ocean waves that defined Portugal’s Age of Discovery. The design is a sophisticated interplay of traditional color and modern pattern.Color Palette &amp; AccentsBase Tone:&nbsp;A deep, regal&nbsp;\"Aethelred Red\"&nbsp;(inspired by Portugal’s historical color) is used for the entire long-sleeve jersey, serving as a powerful and classic canvas.Accent Palette:Aegean Blue/Teal:&nbsp;Featured prominently as a deep, textured contrast on the inner neck collar, sleeve cuff trim, and lower back hem lining. This color, replacing the original lighter blue, evokes the depth of the Atlantic.Metallic Gold:&nbsp;All sponsor logos (Puma) are rendered in metallic gold, adding a touch of prestige.Tonal Pattern:&nbsp;The entire jersey body features an intricate, lighter tonal red woven pattern.Player Edition Details\"NAVEGADORES\" (Navigators):&nbsp;A hidden motto printed inside the V-neck, a private reminder to the player of the unique Portuguese legacy of exploration and skill.Integrated Jacquard-Knit Pattern:&nbsp;The entire jersey body features an intricate, tonal jacquard-knit pattern. It is not printed but woven into the fabric itself, creating a subtle, shifting geometric pattern that mimics ancient nautical compass roses and wave forms.Performance Cut &amp; ULTRAWEAVE Tech:&nbsp;This long-sleeve version is crafted from Puma\'s&nbsp;ULTRAWEAVE&nbsp;material, engineered with advanced moisture-wicking properties and body-mapped cooling zones. The specific \"player cut\" features ultra-lightweight, seamless bonded construction on key panels to reduce drag.Textured Crest:&nbsp;The Portugal federation crest is a textured, three-dimensional element applied with high-frequency heat, giving it depth and prominence.Authentication Seals:&nbsp;Includes a premium \"ULTRAWEAVE\" label at the bottom right and an official circular holographic authentication seal at the bottom left.Cultural SignificanceMore than apparel, this kit is a&nbsp;\"Maritime Monument.\"&nbsp;It is designed to move with the athlete and tell a story. The \"Discovery\" concept honors Portugal\'s commitment to bold, disciplined, and historical achievement. The rich color palette and patterns are meant to inspire a performance that feels as timeless and powerful as the ocean itself.', 'storage/media/product/2026-04-11-JKCK4iDWhJL38alFI3OlITRFphjrdni6EeUygwcj.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-10 19:03:41', '2026-04-11 00:31:04');
