tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; margin-bottom: 0px; color: rgb(57, 28, 29); font-family: AdihausDIN, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">More than apparel, this kit is a <span data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"33\" style=\"border-color: rgb(226, 232, 240); --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(59,130,246,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; font-weight: bolder;\">\"Living Organism.\"</span> It is designed to move and breathe with the athlete. The \"Flow\" concept honors Brazil\'s commitment to expressive, high-speed <i data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"177\" style=\"border-color: rgb(226, 232, 240); --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(59,130,246,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ;\">joga bonito</i> while acknowledging the critical importance of the Amazon to the country\'s national identity. The vibrant energy is meant to inspire not just victory, but a performance that feels as natural and powerful as the river itself.</p>', 400.00, 800.00, 800.00, 0.00, 'amount', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Brazil World Cup 2026 Home Kit Player Edition Full', 'Design Inspiration:&nbsp;This kit embodies a kinetic visualization of Brazil\'s core philosophy—the&nbsp;\"Flow of Futebol.\"&nbsp;It channels the fluid, unstoppable energy of the Amazon River, the&nbsp;pororoca&nbsp;(the tidal bore), and the natural rhythm of&nbsp;samba-futebol. The design is not static; it captures the essence of movement and the vibrant, harmonious chaos of Brazilian nature and culture.Color Palette &amp; AccentsBase Tone:&nbsp;An iconic&nbsp;\"Vibrant Canary Yellow\"&nbsp;that is both electric and historic, providing maximum visibility and an instantly recognizable presence.Accent Palette:Dynamic Teal and Green:&nbsp;Integrated into the side-panel cutouts, these panels use a combination of light turquoise (like the previous kit) and a richer deep green, layered to simulate light reflecting off the water.Midnight Navy:&nbsp;Used for the sharp, angular neck collar, sleeve cuff trim, and structural piping, grounding the brighter elements with a serious, performance-oriented contrast.Emerald Green Swoosh:&nbsp;The Nike logo is executed in a deep emerald, referencing the heart of the rainforest.Player Edition Details\"HARMONIA DO JOGO\" (Harmony of the Game):&nbsp;A hidden motto printed inside the V-neck, a private reminder to the player of the unique Brazilian balance between skill, speed, and soul.Integrated Jacquard-Knit Pattern:&nbsp;The entire jersey body features an intricate, tonal jacquard-knit pattern. It is not printed but woven into the fabric itself, creating a subtle, shifting geometric pattern that mimics water currents and tribal feather work.Performance Cut &amp; ADV Tech:&nbsp;This long-sleeve version is crafted from Nike\'s&nbsp;Dri-FIT ADV&nbsp;material, engineered with advanced moisture-wicking properties and body-mapped cooling zones. The specific \"player cut\" features ultra-lightweight, seamless bonded construction on key panels to reduce drag.Textured Crest:&nbsp;The Brazil federation crest is a textured, three-dimensional element applied with high-frequency heat, giving it depth and prominence.Cultural SignificanceMore than apparel, this kit is a&nbsp;\"Living Organism.\"&nbsp;It is designed to move and breathe with the athlete. The \"Flow\" concept honors Brazil\'s commitment to expressive, high-speed&nbsp;joga bonito&nbsp;while acknowledging the critical importance of the Amazon to the country\'s national identity. The vibrant energy is meant to inspire not just victory, but a performance that feels as natural and powerful as the river itself.', 'storage/media/product/2026-04-11-My4tO6XCNlj75yIAYjVbICQ1B5K16Xkh7SDt4cu4.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-10 19:06:09', '2026-04-11 00:31:23');
