ern Classic.\"</span> By blending the nostalgia of 1998 with futuristic performance tech, it honors Mexico’s legacy of hosting the World Cup (1970, 1986, 2026). The Aztec motifs are a reminder that the team carries the weight of history and the energy of millions into the Estadio Azteca. It is a kit designed not just for the pitch, but for the history books.</p>', 400.00, 800.00, 800.00, 0.00, 'amount', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Mexico World cup 2026 Home kit Player Edition Full', 'Design Inspiration:&nbsp;This kit pays a sophisticated tribute to Mexico’s ancestral heart. Inspired by the legendary 1998 \"Aztec Calendar\" jersey, the 2026 edition features a central motif based on the&nbsp;Piedra del Sol (Sun Stone). Subtle geometric patterns and pre-Hispanic iconography are woven directly into the fabric, symbolizing the strength of the Mexica empire and the unyielding spirit of&nbsp;El Tri&nbsp;as they co-host the world\'s biggest stage.Color Palette &amp; AccentsBase Tone:&nbsp;A rich&nbsp;\"Bold Green\"&nbsp;that signals a proud return to tradition, providing a vibrant canvas for the cultural graphics.Red &amp; White Trim:&nbsp;Sharp red accents on the V-neck collar and sleeve cuffs, paired with white&nbsp;Adidas 3-Stripes&nbsp;on the shoulders, completing the iconic national tricolor.Lenticular Crest:&nbsp;A state-of-the-art, heat-applied Mexico federation crest that shifts slightly in the light, blending modern innovation with historical pride.Off-White Details:&nbsp;\"Bone-white\" accents used in the intricate patterns to mimic traditional indigenous embroidery.Player Edition Details\"SOMOS MÉXICO\" (We Are Mexico):&nbsp;Printed elegantly on the back of the neck, serving as a unifying call to arms for players and fans alike.Holographic Authenticity Seal:&nbsp;Located near the hem, featuring a hidden UV print to certify its elite status.Full Sleeve Performance:&nbsp;The long-sleeve silhouette is designed for a streamlined, aerodynamic fit, offering added coverage without sacrificing agility.CLIMACOOL+ Technology:&nbsp;Engineered with body-mapped 3D mechanical stretch fabric and advanced moisture management to keep athletes cool in the North American summer heat.Cultural SignificanceMore than just a uniform, this kit is a&nbsp;\"Modern Classic.\"&nbsp;By blending the nostalgia of 1998 with futuristic performance tech, it honors Mexico’s legacy of hosting the World Cup (1970, 1986, 2026). The Aztec motifs are a reminder that the team carries the weight of history and the energy of millions into the Estadio Azteca. It is a kit designed not just for the pitch, but for the history books.', 'storage/media/product/2026-04-11-ZQgkpCQA8KKw7ZgDOutIPbUTQGwN8T2U8lBa1MJR.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-10 19:08:30', '2026-04-11 00:32:04');
