tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(59,130,246,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; font-weight: bolder;\">Cultural Significance:</span> This kit isn’t just apparel—it’s a statement. It celebrates Portugal’s legacy of discovery and its fearless approach to football. The wave motif reflects a team ready to make ripples on the world stage, especially as they prepare for the 2026 FIFA World Cup in North America</p>', 400.00, 800.00, 800.00, 0.00, 'amount', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Portugal World Cup 2026 Away Kit Player Edition Full', 'Design Inspiration:&nbsp;This concept kit channels Portugal’s deep-rooted connection to the sea. The&nbsp;light blue and white wave pattern&nbsp;sweeping across the front and sleeves evokes the Atlantic tides that have shaped the nation’s history. It’s a visual metaphor for exploration, resilience, and the spirit of the Seleção.Color Palette &amp; Accents:Base tones:&nbsp;A fusion of&nbsp;light blue and white, symbolizing oceanic calm and clarity.Teal side panels:&nbsp;Add contrast and fluidity, enhancing the wave motif.Maroon Puma logo: Positioned above the crest, it introduces a regal touch that complements the overall aesthetic.Portugal crest:&nbsp;Centered on the chest, reinforcing national identity with pride.Special Edition Details:“PORTUGAL” inside the collar: A subtle nod to patriotism, visible only to the wearer.La Dérive emblem near the hem: Marks this as a&nbsp;limited-edition collaboration, blending fashion-forward design with football tradition.Player Version cut: Engineered for performance, featuring&nbsp;Puma’s DryCELL technology&nbsp;for moisture control and a&nbsp;slim, athletic fit&nbsp;that mirrors what the pros wear on the pitch.Cultural Significance:&nbsp;This kit isn’t just apparel—it’s a statement. It celebrates Portugal’s legacy of discovery and its fearless approach to football. The wave motif reflects a team ready to make ripples on the world stage, especially as they prepare for the 2026 FIFA World Cup in North America', 'storage/media/product/2026-04-11-sRvDVrSVa3xqbGcs5hzOn5KaKNAPZmxvGCAQxpQH.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-10 19:10:12', '2026-04-11 00:32:22');
