s prominently placed on the chest, topped with the&nbsp;four gold stars&nbsp;representing Uruguay’s historic world titles.Textured Fabric:&nbsp;The player version features a specialized knit pattern throughout the body, designed not just for visual depth but for targeted breathability in high-heat zones.Performance TechnologyDri-FIT ADV:&nbsp;As a player-issue \"Match\" jersey, it utilizes Nike’s most advanced moisture-wicking technology, keeping athletes dry through 90 minutes of elite play.Aero-FIT Construction:&nbsp;This 2026 edition introduces Nike’s new Aero-FIT engineering, offering a streamlined, \"second-skin\" fit that reduces drag and improves range of motion compared to the standard Stadium (replica) version.Lightweight Materials:&nbsp;Crafted from 100% recycled polyester, the fabric is significantly lighter and more breathable than previous iterations, featuring heat-applied logos to reduce friction against the skin.', 'storage/media/product/2026-04-11-YeQOXsuCEGUnyl4mHnsKZMtQgvWWY6LjnpSp5Po4.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-10 19:12:10', '2026-04-11 00:31:46');
