e: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; font-weight: bolder;\">Heritage Sign-Off:</span> A specialized emblem on the inside of the neck commemorates the 56th anniversary of the 1970 victory, acting as a \"hidden motivator\" for the players as they take the pitch.</p></li><li style=\"border-color: rgb(226, 232, 240); --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(59,130,246,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"5,2,0\" style=\"border-color: rgb(226, 232, 240); --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(59,130,246,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span data-path-to-node=\"5,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\" style=\"border-color: rgb(226, 232, 240); --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(59,130,246,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; font-weight: bolder;\">Heat-Pressed Authenticity:</span> To maximize agility and minimize weight, the CBF crest and the Nike Swoosh are heat-applied with a textured silicone finish rather than traditional embroidery, offering a sleek, distraction-free performance fit.</p></li></ul>', 400.00, 700.00, 700.00, 0.00, 'amount', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Brazil World Cup 2026 Home Kit Player Edition', 'The&nbsp;Brazil 2026 World Cup Home Kit (Player Edition)&nbsp;is a tribute to the&nbsp;Seleção’s&nbsp;unrivaled history—fusing the legendary 1970 aesthetic with high-performance 2026 innovation.Design &amp; Legacy1970 \"Spirit of Pelé\" Inspiration:&nbsp;The jersey returns to a clean, traditional \"Yellow Canary\" base, drawing direct visual cues from the iconic kit worn by the 1970 World Cup-winning squad. It captures the essence of the \"Golden Era\" while updating it for a modern generation.Distorted Flag Geometric:&nbsp;Look closely and you’ll find a subtle, tonal geometric pattern throughout the yellow fabric. This abstract design is a distorted reimagining of the Brazilian flag, representing the energy and motion of the Brazilian&nbsp;Ginga&nbsp;style of play.Contrast Dual-Tone Blue:&nbsp;The detailing features a unique combination of \"Light Mint\" and \"Geode Teal\" on the cuffs and rounded collar, providing a fresh, vibrant contrast to the classic yellow that pops under stadium lights.Player Edition FeaturesNike Aero-FIT Innovation:&nbsp;This elite version debuts Nike’s latest Aero-FIT technology. The bespoke knit fabric is engineered with targeted ventilation maps in high-heat zones, ensuring the athletes stay cool during the intensity of the World Cup.Heritage Sign-Off:&nbsp;A specialized emblem on the inside of the neck commemorates the 56th anniversary of the 1970 victory, acting as a \"hidden motivator\" for the players as they take the pitch.Heat-Pressed Authenticity:&nbsp;To maximize agility and minimize weight, the CBF crest and the Nike Swoosh are heat-applied with a textured silicone finish rather than traditional embroidery, offering a sleek, distraction-free performance fit.', 'storage/media/product/2026-04-11-i4YVdDm9if7LuQkyfzjvMuq0sI2aSwZ4epkeYHZI.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-10 19:15:00', '2026-04-11 00:30:32');
