 --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(59,130,246,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; font-weight: bolder;\">Heat-Applied Trim:</span> To minimize weight and friction, the iconic Three Lions crest and Nike Swoosh are heat-pressed rather than embroidered. Above the crest, a single <span data-path-to-node=\"5,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"165\" style=\"border-color: rgb(226, 232, 240); --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(59,130,246,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; font-weight: bolder;\">Gold Star</span> shines brightly, commemorating the legendary 1966 victory.</p></li></ul>', 400.00, 700.00, 700.00, 0.00, 'amount', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'England World Cup 2026 Home Kit Player Edition', 'The&nbsp;England 2026 World Cup Home Kit (Player Edition)&nbsp;is a masterclass in minimalist elegance—designed for the Three Lions to conquer the world stage with a blend of heritage and cutting-edge innovation.Design &amp; LegacyThe \"Happy and Glorious\" Slogan:&nbsp;Tucked discreetly inside the collar is the patriotic inscription&nbsp;\"Happy and Glorious.\"&nbsp;Pulled directly from the national anthem, it serves as a private reminder of the nation’s pride for the players as they tunnel out.Intricate Lion Jacquard:&nbsp;The classic white base is elevated by a sophisticated, tonal jacquard pattern woven into the fabric. The design features a repeating motif of lions and stars that shifts under stadium lights, adding a premium texture to the \"Three Lions\" identity.Modern Accents:&nbsp;A sharp navy V-neck collar is paired with matching navy cuffs and subtle red side inserts. This tricolor palette pays homage to iconic England kits of the 1980s and 90s while maintaining a sleek, 2026 aesthetic.Player Edition FeaturesNike Aero-Fit Technology:&nbsp;Replacing previous fabrics, this elite-tier material is engineered with targeted ventilation zones. The ultra-lightweight, high-stretch knit is designed to regulate body temperature during the high-intensity humidity of a North American summer.Precision Silhouette:&nbsp;The \"Player Edition\" features a slim, athletic cut with ergonomic raglan sleeves, reducing drag and allowing for a full range of motion during sprints and strikes.Heat-Applied Trim:&nbsp;To minimize weight and friction, the iconic Three Lions crest and Nike Swoosh are heat-pressed rather than emb