-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(59,130,246,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; font-weight: bolder;\">\"Somos México\"</span> (We Are Mexico) is printed on the back of the neck as a call to national unity.</p></li></ul>', 400.00, 700.00, 700.00, 0.00, 'amount', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Mexico World Cup 2026 Home Kit Player Edition', 'The&nbsp;Mexico 2026 Home Kit (Player Edition), manufactured by Adidas, marks a highly anticipated return to the nation\'s iconic green as they prepare to co-host the FIFA World Cup 2026.Design ConceptThe kit is a direct homage to the legendary&nbsp;1998 World Cup design&nbsp;worn in France, widely considered one of the most iconic shirts in football history. It aims to bridge the gap between different generations of fans by blending 90s nostalgia with high-performance modern aesthetics.Visual DescriptionPrimary Color:&nbsp;The jersey features a traditional&nbsp;\"Bold Green\"&nbsp;base, moving away from the recent experimental black-and-pink palettes.Aztec Motif:&nbsp;Just like the original 1998 ABA Sport shirt, the 2026 version features a large, central&nbsp;Aztec-inspired graphic. This version is more intricate and streamlined, using darker geometric patterns to form the emblem.Logos &amp; Crest:&nbsp;The kit features a new&nbsp;lenticular heat-applied federation crest&nbsp;and Adidas logo, which creates a unique, shifting appearance when viewed from different angles.Accents:&nbsp;The design is finished with&nbsp;red and white details&nbsp;on a retro-modern EQT-style collar and sleeve cuffs.Unifying Detail:&nbsp;The phrase&nbsp;\"Somos México\"&nbsp;(We Are Mexico) is printed on the back of the neck as a call to national unity.', 'storage/media/product/2026-04-11-mJJRV32MkdE6omgcFhGWgdrwpAekXU7Z0L6ZT9wK.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-10 19:21:13', '2026-04-11 00:29:33');
