aturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"border-color: rgb(226, 232, 240); --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(59,130,246,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; font-weight: bolder;\">For the Game</span>: Proof that kits can be cultural artifacts, not just uniforms.</span></p></li></ul>', 400.00, 900.00, 900.00, 0.00, 'amount', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Brazil World Cup 2026 Away kit Player Edition', 'Few jerseys carry the weight of history like Brazil’s. Five stars above the crest remind the world of their unmatched World Cup triumphs, while every new kit must honor that legacy and push the boundaries of design. The Brazil 2026 Concept Kit achieves exactly that.Design HighlightsBase &amp; Stripes: A bold black foundation with electric blue vertical stripes, symbolizing Brazil’s fearless energy on the global stage.Crest &amp; Stars: The iconic Seleção crest, crowned with five golden stars, proudly sits at the heart of the jersey.Jordan Collaboration: The Jumpman logo in yellow marks a daring partnership with Jordan Brand, merging football heritage with streetwear culture.Accents &amp; Details:Yellow piping and green side panels echo the national flag.A diamond emblem inside the collar pays homage to Brazil’s vibrant identity.Authentic Licensed Product tag ensures collectors recognize its exclusivity.Cultural StorytellingThis concept kit isn’t just apparel—it’s a statement. The black-and-blue palette reflects resilience and modernity, while the traditional green and yellow accents tie it back to Brazil’s roots. The Jordan collaboration signals a new era where football kits transcend the pitch, becoming lifestyle icons.Why It MattersFor Fans: A fresh look that still honors Brazil’s timeless footballing spirit.For Collectors: A rare fusion of Seleção heritage and Jordan’s global influence.For the Game: Proof that kits can be cultural artifacts, not just uniforms.', 'storage/media/product/2026-04-11-xjj477a9Fpl7Sufqos491hidMunoz1kqE3P29BMC.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-10 19:24:14', '2026-04-23 22:33:00');
