ain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; margin-bottom: 0px; color: rgb(57, 28, 29); font-family: AdihausDIN, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">The artistic vertical line concept makes this away kit stand out as a limited-edition style statement—perfect for fans who appreciate both performance innovation and cultural storytelling.</p>', 400.00, 700.00, 700.00, 0.00, 'amount', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Japan World Cup 2026 Away Kit Player Edition', 'Design InspirationThe Japan 2026 Away Kit embraces a clean white base, elevated by subtle multi-color vertical streaks that represent unity, diversity, and the vibrant culture of Japan. The flowing lines reflect harmony and forward motion—symbolizing the Samurai Blue’s ambition on football’s biggest stage.Color PaletteBase:&nbsp;Crystal WhiteAccents:&nbsp;Soft pastel vertical lines in pink, blue, yellow, and purpleDetails:&nbsp;Black three-stripe shoulder branding and black ribbed collar/sleeve trimsThe contrast between the minimalist white canvas and colorful pinstripes creates a modern yet artistic aesthetic.Fabric &amp; FitCrafted with premium lightweight performance fabric, the&nbsp;Player Version&nbsp;features a slim, athletic cut tailored for match-day intensity. The ergonomic construction enhances mobility while maintaining a sharp, professional silhouette.TechnologyBuilt with advanced moisture-wicking performance technology (AEROREADY), the jersey ensures optimal breathability and sweat control—keeping players cool and focused under pressure.Authentic DetailingHeat-applied&nbsp;Japan Football Association&nbsp;(JFA)&nbsp;crest for reduced weightAdidas performance logo in monochrome finishRibbed V-neck collar with dual-tone stripingOfficial player-grade finishing for a true on-pitch feelCollector’s AppealThe artistic vertical line concept makes this away kit stand out as a limited-edition style statement—perfect for fans who appreciate both performance innovation and cultural storytelling.', 'storage/media/product/2026-04-11-4pjsR5