urability.Care Instructions: Hand wash recommended to preserve print quality—machine washing may damage the detailing.&nbsp;&nbsp;Legacy Meets PerformanceThis kit isn’t just about aesthetics—it’s a celebration of Argentina’s rich goalkeeping heritage. The 1990-inspired pattern connects past and present, while the sleek black base reflects the confidence of a reigning world champion squad heading into 2026.', 'storage/media/product/2026-04-11-ZpL2MydRqcsPIFFIaRo387A5HGlehYIyZmp4MNsr.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-10 19:32:53', '2026-04-10 23:46:48');
