ron pattern across the chest echoes the geometric motifs of Germany’s iconic 1990 and 1994 kits, reinterpreted for a new generation.&nbsp;Crest &amp; BrandingGerman National Emblem: Positioned over the heart, the four-star crest proudly commemorates Germany’s World Cup victories in 1954, 1974, 1990, and 2014.Adidas Logo: Featured on the right chest, reinforcing the brand’s legacy partnership with Die Mannschaft.Shoulder Stripes: Classic white Adidas stripes run along the shoulders, adding contrast and continuity.&nbsp;Fit &amp; FabricPlayer Half Cut: Tailored for performance, this version mimics the authentic player fit—slim, aerodynamic, and match-ready.Material: Crafted with Climacool+ technology, ensuring advanced breathability and moisture control for high-intensity play.Hem Tag: A subtle woven label at the bottom left adds a premium finish and authenticity marker.&nbsp;Visual ImpactThis concept kit is not just apparel—it’s a statement of intent. Whether worn on pitch or styled off it, it reflects Germany’s footballing excellence and design-forward ethos.&nbsp;Ideal ForCollectors seeking rare concept piecesFans wanting a fresh take on national prideStylists blending sport and streetwearContent creators showcasing kit culture', 'storage/media/product/2026-04-11-c9fdTXWDTtY6Bmr0uDmbCkk8rlUmZD3P5j3WDx8G.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-10 19:35:41', '2026-04-10 23:46:38');
