tion Cut: Tailored for match-day intensity with a slim, athletic silhouette.Fabric: Lightweight, breathable, and engineered for peak performance under pressure.Technology: Nike’s&nbsp;DRI-FIT ADV&nbsp;system keeps you cool and dry through every sprint and tackle.&nbsp;Collector’s InsightThis concept kit isn’t just a jersey—it’s a statement. With its futuristic pattern and bold color contrasts, it’s destined to become a standout piece in any serious football kit collection. Ideal for display, wear, or match-day flair.', 'storage/media/product/2026-04-11-xN5fDK4m6RAElAZRnrYk6UzgCqbM0tLJnrSRwKv1.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-10 19:38:40', '2026-04-10 23:46:29');
