ederation Crest: The Croatian Football Federation (HNS) badge sits proudly at the heart, featuring the red-and-white checker shield, blue “HNS” initials, and a golden football.Nike Swoosh: Positioned just below the crest in crisp white—marking the final Nike appearance before Adidas takes over post-2026.Authenticity Tag: A black and gold “Authentic Licensed Product” label near the hem confirms its status as official player gear.Historical SignificanceThis kit is&nbsp;Nike’s last for Croatia, closing a design era that began in 1998. Starting summer 2026,&nbsp;Adidas will become the new kit supplier, ushering in a fresh visual identity.', 'storage/media/product/2026-04-11-GTUW52ft2ORSIWi1JPslKCRflmkrJWjIQulu9asO.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-10 19:40:38', '2026-04-10 23:46:20');
