-tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; font-weight: bolder;\">slim, athletic fit</span> that mirrors what the pros wear on the pitch.</p></li></ul><p style=\"border-color: rgb(226, 232, 240); --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(59,130,246,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; margin-bottom: 0px; color: rgb(57, 28, 29); font-family: AdihausDIN, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"border-color: rgb(226, 232, 240); --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(59,130,246,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; font-weight: bolder;\">Cultural Significance:</span> This kit isn’t just apparel—it’s a statement. It celebrates Portugal’s legacy of discovery and its fearless approach to football. The wave motif reflects a team ready to make ripples on the world stage, especially as they prepare for the 2026 FIFA World Cup in North America</p>', 400.00, 700.00, 700.00, 0.00, 'amount', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Portugal World Cup 2026 Away Kit Player Edition', 'Design Inspiration:&nbsp;This concept kit channels Portugal’s deep-rooted connection to the sea. The&nbsp;light blue and white wave pattern&nbsp;sweeping across the front and sleeves evokes the Atlantic tides that have shaped the nation’s history. It’s a visual metaphor for exploration, resilience, and the spirit of the Seleção.Color Palette &amp; Accents:Base tones:&nbsp;A fusion of&nbsp;light blue and white, symbolizing oceanic calm and clarity.Teal side panels:&nbsp;Add contrast and fluidity, enhancing the wave motif.Maroon Puma logo: Positioned above the crest, it introduces a regal touch that complements the overall aesthetic.Portugal crest:&nbsp;Centered on the chest, reinforcing national identity with pride.Special Edition Details:“PORTUGAL” inside the collar: A subtle nod to patriotism, visible only to the wearer.La Dérive emblem near the hem: Marks this as a&nbsp;limited-edition collaboration, blending fashion-forward design with football tradition.Player Version cut: Engineered for performance, featuring&nbsp;Puma’s DryCELL technology&nbsp;for moisture control and a&nbsp;slim, athletic fit&nbsp;that mirrors what the pros wear on the pitch.Cultural Significance:&nbsp;This kit isn’t just apparel—it’s a statement. It celebrates Portugal’s legacy of discovery and its fearless approach to football. The wave motif reflects a team ready to make ripples on the world stage, especially as they prepare for the 2026 FIFA World Cup in North America', 'storage/media/product/2026-04-11-XulBlTrYssAM8qHeYtg2BsHUWi2zHZcFrAfKUzZX.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-10 19:43:50', '2026-04-10 23:46:11');
