ng-color: rgba(59,130,246,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; margin-bottom: 0px; color: rgb(57, 28, 29); font-family: AdihausDIN, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">This kit isn’t just apparel—it’s a canvas of pride. The swirling design evokes the rhythm of tango, the brushstrokes of Argentine art, and the passion of La Albiceleste fans worldwide. It’s a celebration of legacy, worn by champions.</p>', 400.00, 700.00, 700.00, 0.00, 'amount', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Argentina Away Kit WC-26 Player Version Half', 'Legacy meets artistry.&nbsp;The 2026 Argentina Away Kit is a visual tribute to the nation’s footballing soul. Crafted by Adidas, this player version jersey reimagines tradition with a daring black canvas, overlaid by a&nbsp;vibrant swirl of sky blue and white floral patterns—a nod to Argentine art and national colors.&nbsp;Design HighlightsBase Color:&nbsp;Deep black, symbolizing strength and elegance.Graphic Pattern:&nbsp;Abstract floral swirls in sky blue and white, inspired by Argentine painting styles.Logos:Left Chest:&nbsp;Argentine Football Association (AFA) crest with&nbsp;three stars, celebrating World Cup victories in 1978, 1986, and 2022.Right Chest:&nbsp;Retro&nbsp;Adidas Trefoil logo, marking a nostalgic return to classic branding.Sleeves &amp; Collar:&nbsp;White trim adds contrast and sharpness.Shoulder Detail:&nbsp;Signature&nbsp;three white stripes&nbsp;for iconic Adidas identity.Fabric Tech:&nbsp;AEROREADY moisture control&nbsp;ensures elite performance and comfort.&nbsp;Player Version FeaturesSlim athletic cut&nbsp;tailored for elite performance.Heat-applied crest and logos&nbsp;for reduced weight.Advanced ventilation zones&nbsp;for optimal breathability during high-intensity play.&nbsp;Cultural ResonanceThis kit isn’t just apparel—it’s a canvas of pride. The swirling design evokes the rhythm of tango, the brushstrokes of Argentine art, and the passion of La Albiceleste fans worldwide. It’s a celebration of legacy, worn by champions.', 'storage/media/product/2026-04-11-fJPXBRZkVnA3WvffbAFBJ6lDIFIfopWusruUYe7V.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-10 19:46:12', '2026-04-10 23:46:01');
