numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(59,130,246,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-url=\"guide://action?prefill=Tell%20me%20more%20about%3A%20Long%20sleeves%20with%20integrated%20cuffs\" style=\"border-color: rgb(226, 232, 240); --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(59,130,246,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ;\">Long sleeves with integrated cuffs</span>: Designed for cooler match conditions, with red and yellow accents running down the arms.</p></li></ul>', 400.00, 950.00, 950.00, 0.00, 'amount', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Spain World Cup 2026 Home Kit Player Edition Full', 'A tribute to La Roja’s enduring legacy, the 2026 Spain home jersey by Adidas is a masterclass in heritage-driven design. Worn by the national team during their campaign in North America, this full-sleeve player version is engineered for performance and pride.&nbsp;Design &amp; AestheticDeep red body: Symbolizing passion and unity, the jersey’s core color echoes Spain’s iconic footballing identity.Dark navy sleeves: A bold contrast that adds modern flair while enhancing the silhouette.Red-yellow-red Three Stripes: Running down the shoulders, these stripes mirror the Spanish flag, reinforcing national symbolism.Thin yellow pinstripes: Subtle vertical detailing adds elegance and depth, inspired by classic Spanish kits of the past.&nbsp;Crest &amp; BrandingSpain national team crest: Embroidered on the left chest, topped with a star to honor their 2010 World Cup triumph.Adidas logo in yellow: Positioned on the right chest, balancing the visual symmetry.Authenticity tag: Near the hem, confirming its player-grade status.&nbsp;Fabric &amp; FitClimacool technology: Advanced moisture-wicking mesh zones ensure breathability during high-intensity play.Athletic cut: Tailored for elite players, offering a second-skin fit that enhances movement and reduces drag.Long sleeves with integrated cuffs: Designed for cooler match conditions, with red and yellow accents running down the arms.', 'storage/media/product/2026-04-11-9x9xdVFsH0EXVOFnTIoUlPcdI4cCZksqp3BMElXk.webp', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-10 19:48:35', '2026-04-23 22:34:44');
